<article>
    <p>The <mark>web development</mark> landscape is constantly evolving. Designers and developers must stay updated with the latest tools and frameworks to build modern, user-friendly websites.</p>

    <p>Responsive design has become crucial. With the rise of mobile devices, ensuring a website looks great on all screens is <mark>mandatory</mark> for user satisfaction.</p>

    <p>Performance optimization is another key factor. Websites must load quickly to retain users and improve SEO rankings, which is why techniques like lazy loading and code minification are widely used.</p>

    <p><blockquote>“Good design is obvious. Great design is transparent.” – Joe Sparano</blockquote></p>

    <p>Finally, accessibility cannot be ignored. Making sure websites are usable by people with <mark>disabilities</mark> is both a legal requirement and an ethical responsibility.</p>
